note.p:
Sisco briefed  Rifai on May 18 and then briefed Sharaf the following day. (Telegram 87901 to Amman, May 20;
                    National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Box 616, Country Files, Middle East, Jordan, Vol. VII;
                    and telegram 88358 to Amman, May 20; ibid., Box 1163, Saunders Files, Middle
                    East Negotiations Files, Middle East—Jarring Talks, May 10–18, 1971)
